  "text": "Skip to content\nARK\nARK\nSHOP\nOUTERWEAR\nSHELLS\nMIDLAYERS\nACCESSORIES\nSUPPORT\n\nA\nR\nK\n\nJACKETS AND TOQUES FOR THE COLD\n\nShells, down, fleece and knit toques for real winter.\n\nExplore the collection\nShop toques\n\nArc'teryx outerwear and toques. Prices in CAD.\n\nTHE COLLECTION\n\nFour layers to start: a shell, a down hoody, a vest and a fleece. Choose your size right on the card.\n\nShop all 7 pieces\n\nPrices in CAD.\n\nArc'teryx Beta SL Jacket\n\n$219.99\n\nBlack\n\nSizes S–XXL, 14 colours\n\nChoose size\nArc'teryx Thorium Hoody\n\n$159.99\n\nBlue\n\nSizes M–3XL, 3 colours\n\nChoose size\nArc'teryx Down Vest\n\n$99.99\n\nNavy\n\nSizes S–XXL, 3 colours\n\nChoose size\nArc'teryx Grid Fleece Half-Zip\n\n$79.99\n\nIce Blue\n\nSizes XS–L, 5 colours\n\nChoose size\n\nWIND\n\nShells\n\nThe outer layer. A shell goes on over everything else and meets the weather first.\n\nExplore the collection\nArc'teryx Alpha SV Jacket\n\n$279.99\n\nSizes S–XXL, 3 colours\n\nChoose size\nWHITEOUT\n\nWhen the horizon disappears, the mid layer keeps you moving.\n\nDiscover the Grid fleece\n\nDEEP\nCOLD\n\nInsulation\n\nInsulated pieces hold warmth in, under a shell or on their own.\n\nArc'teryx Macai Jacket\n\n$369.99\n\nSizes S–XXL, 1 colour\n\nChoose size\nCOLD CITY\n\nThe last layer, on top, for the walk home.\n\nSee the toques\nWINTER ESSENTIALS\n\nThe last layer, on top. Four colours of the Bird Head toque, chosen for the cold.\n\nSee all 24 colours\nArc'teryx Bird Toque\n\n$39.99\n\nBlack / Grey\n\n24 colours\n\nChoose colour\nArc'teryx Bird Toque\n\n$39.99\n\nNavy / White\n\n24 colours\n\nChoose colour\nArc'teryx Bird Toque\n\n$39.99\n\nBlue\n\n24 colours\n\nChoose colour\nArc'teryx Bird Toque\n\n$39.99\n\nOff-White / Grey\n\n24 colours\n\nChoose colour\nBUYING FROM ARK\n\nFree from $100\n\nStandard shipping in Canada\n\n$12 CAD under $100. Tracked, order to door.\n\nShipping & delivery\n\n30 days\n\nTo return or exchange\n\nWrong size? Swap it, subject to